# Light theme only

Concordare’s default (and only) global theme is light.

- Keep `ThemeProvider` with `forcedTheme="light"` and `enableSystem={false}`
- Never pass Sonner / theme-aware UI `theme="system"` as the app default
- Do not add a dark-mode toggle for the product shell
- Scoped `.dark` wrappers are OK only for intentional local contrast (e.g. demo controls bar)

See `design.md` → Theme.
